exports[`requires an independent full input/action/budget confirmation in Chinese=false 1`] = `"Isolated engineering taskCopy the selected complete inputs into a fresh workspace, then let one bounded Agent turn choose only the reviewed build/test actions. Review the full task, copy input closure, exact commands and independent budget before confirming. Tests and user acceptance remain separate.Experiment identity (UUID; generated when blank)Case identity (UUID; generated when blank)Source workspaceManaged connectionModelOptional committed Notebook source SessionOptional current Desktop cache mode to confirmNo cache factor confirmationnativeoffsessionComplete relative input roots (one per line)Reviewed action IDs (one per line)Complete task textIndependent request, output, tool, action and time limits (JSON){"requests":2,"outputTokensPerRequest":64,"outputTokens":128,"toolCalls":2,"actions":1,"durationMs":30000}Resource limits are checked between operations and after drainage. Action-time disk peaks and Host memory peaks remain unknown. Existing copies and outputs are retained on refusal.Copy, retained-copy and logical Session checkpoint limits (JSON){"workspaceBytes":33554432,"workspaceEntries":1024,"retainedWorkspaceBytes":536870912,"sessionBytes":2097152,"sessionDiskBytes":2097152,"sessionEvents":4096}Complete Shell output and retained spill limits (JSON){"outputBytes":8388608,"retainedSpillBytes":134217728}Preview isolated taskConfirm input, copied workspace, commands and budgetRetained engineering identityRead retained engineering taskCancel and drain engineering task"`;

exports[`requires an independent full input/action/budget confirmation in Chinese=true 1`] = `"隔离工程任务将选定的完整输入复制到新工作区，再由一个有界 Agent turn 只选择已审阅的构建／测试动作。确认前检查完整任务、复制输入闭包、准确命令和独立预算。测试与用户验收分别保留。实验身份（UUID；空白时生成）算例身份（UUID；空白时生成）来源工作区受管连接模型可选已提交 Notebook 源 Session可选需要确认的当前 Desktop 缓存模式不确认缓存因素nativeoffsession完整的相对输入根（每行一个）已审阅动作 ID（每行一个）完整任务文本独立请求、输出、工具、动作及时间限额（JSON）{"requests":2,"outputTokensPerRequest":64,"outputTokens":128,"toolCalls":2,"actions":1,"durationMs":30000}资源限额在操作之间及排空后检查。动作期间磁盘峰值和 Host 内存峰值保持未知。拒绝后保留已有副本和输出。副本、保留副本及逻辑 Session 检查点限额（JSON）{"workspaceBytes":33554432,"workspaceEntries":1024,"retainedWorkspaceBytes":536870912,"sessionBytes":2097152,"sessionDiskBytes":2097152,"sessionEvents":4096}完整 Shell 输出及保留 spill 限额（JSON）{"outputBytes":8388608,"retainedSpillBytes":134217728}预览隔离任务确认输入、复制工作区、命令及预算保留工程任务身份读取保留工程任务取消并排空工程任务"`;
